Portions derived from yfinance:
- ported logic: Yahoo Finance endpoint usage, request parameters, response parsing,
  session/crumb handling and price repair algorithms
- vendored Protocol Buffers definition (pricing.proto) used by the live streaming module
- ported test data (price repair test cases and their CSV data)

yfin is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or vetted by Yahoo, Inc. Yahoo Finance data is
intended for personal use only; refer to Yahoo's terms of use.
